Scope of this licence

This licence covers the author-written analysis and rendering code in this
repository.

It does NOT cover, and must not be read as granting rights to:

  - third-party software called as a dependency (CopyKAT, SCEVAN, inferCNV,
    Seurat, DESeq2, edgeR, fgsea, limma, sctransform, yaGST and others);
    these retain their own licences and are not redistributed here;
  - public datasets and gene-set resources referenced by the analyses
    (GEO/BioProject accessions, MSigDB Hallmark, HGNC, UCSC); these are
    obtained from their own sources under their own terms;
  - the manuscript text, figures, figure legends and supplementary tables,
    which are separate works with their own rights.

No third-party source code is vendored in this repository. See
docs/third_party_code_and_attribution.md for the attribution record.
